    "text": "A non-sale Sealed Battle promo card pack holding one of three cards at random: Ethan's Ho-Oh ex 169/SV-P, Cynthia's Garchomp ex 170/SV-P or Arven's Mabosstiff ex 171/SV-P. From 16 May to 14 June 2025 each four-player Heat Wave Arena Sealed Battle at Pokémon Card Shops gave a pack to its winner and another to the winner of a rock-paper-scissors game among the other three; at the release tournaments held from 17 May 2025 the winner received all three cards and each top-four player a pack."
